Steps to create certificate.
  1. lets create a folder:
    mkdir sree-user && cd sree-user
  2. Generate a key using openssl :
    openssl genrsa -out sree.key 2048
  3. Generate a Client Sign Request (CSR) :
    openssl req -new -key sree.key -out sree.csr -subj "/CN=sree/O=group1"
  4. Generate the certificate (CRT) :
    openssl x509 -req -in sree.csr -CA ~/.minikube/ca.crt -CAkey ~/.minikube/ca.key \
-CAcreateserial -out sree.crt -days 500
Steps to create user.
  1. lets create a user:
  kubectl config set-credentials sree --client-certificate=sree.crt --client-key=sree

